    "Runs claude rm. It never discards work: if the node has uncommitted or unpushed changes, or its worktree is still there, the server refuses and tells you why.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ejecuta claude rm. Nunca descarta trabajo: si el nodo tiene cambios sin commit o sin push, o su worktree sigue ahí, el servidor se niega y te dice por qué."
          }
        }
      }
    },
